# Scope and Priorities

Do not build: CEX integration, many collateral types, cross-chain credit, institutional prime brokerage, complex portfolio margin, AI agents as the primary product, DAO governance, tokenomics, many trading venues, a complex liquidation engine, full institutional underwriting, dozens of risk parameters.

P0 must-have: Credit Vault, Credit Account, Risk Policy, onchain trade enforcement, Credit Score, Adaptive Risk.

P1 strongly recommended: real trade execution, LP yield, stress simulation.

P2 later: multiple credit markets, multiple venues, AI agents.

P3 do not build for the hackathon: cross-chain, DAO/token.

One USDC Trading Credit Market for MVP. Multiple risk markets are roadmap.

Simple deterministic loss handling: losses reduce equity, raise risk, lower credit; breach of safety threshold triggers position reduction. No institutional liquidation system.

Keep one simplified Monad-native execution path. Do not integrate external venues in the MVP.
